    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f44fb2041eb5027d61e0f58",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真昼の空でさえ眩く輝く星のように――\r\n4つ星の描き出す時代は、終わらない。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a466aa33166e9c6b673ef64d434e99840e2bb639bd286856f207e23a942e04a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033436.json",
