    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d691fb659c059a79ac1277c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『宝塚記念』に向けたある日、\r\nアドマイヤベガはメイショウドトウと共に\n『天皇賞（春）』を観に来ていた。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ead41d4c61a3b9e9fedcc826533bb3d6529c6de10bf2df2d58ef06623eba6456",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033437.json",
      "json_path": [
